      "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story.\nAsset type: one 3-column × 3-row atlas of nine ORIGINAL standalone picture-book scenes for an early-grade language lesson. Equal cells exactly at thirds horizontally and vertically; every subject stays safely inside one cell; no shared borders, panels overlap, text, labels, numbers, signs, or watermark. Fine paper grain, matte gouache, quiet cream and deep pine green, soft apricot and persimmon, crisp friendly cut-paper contours. Art must remain meaningful at 96 pixels.\nTop left: a small cartoon monkey on the grass by a wide shallow-looking stone water basin at night, staring down at a clear round pale moon reflection in the water. Show the monkey and basin clearly, calm illustration with no dramatic danger. Top middle: an original side silhouette illustration of three little cartoon monkeys holding onto one another in a fanciful story scene, trying to reach a wavering moon reflection on the water. Artistic storybook view, not an instruction diagram, no children or people, no realistic safety setup. Top right: older cartoon monkey pauses and raises its head to look UP at the clearly visible crescent-free full white moon in dark blue-green night sky, leafy tree in the background.\nMiddle left: a school-age girl with short black hair and orange scarf has just opened a picture book next to a tabletop microphone, finger on the first picture, about to begin. Middle center: the same girl cheerfully bowing to a small audience after the reading, closed book on the table and hands clapping. Middle right: the same girl turns away and walks off, closed untouched book on an otherwise empty table. All three original distinct actions and child proportions.\nBottom left: different story rehearsal composition inside a simple community room. A child speaker at the LEFT, one peer seated in the center and two at the far RIGHT, listeners visibly face the speaker. Leave clear open space in the middle at face height for diagrams to be added later. Bottom middle: quiet exhibit in a different room. Two children, a speaker at far LEFT and one close listener immediately to her right, a separate person at far RIGHT absorbed in looking at an artwork. Leave clear space at face height; no visual sound waves. Bottom right: one ORIGINAL cartoon monkey scene with three clear separate regions for pointing out details: upper-right full white moon, center-left treetop branch, lower-center pale ripples on a basin of water. A small monkey looks up from between the basin and sky. Keep all three features fully within the cell and away from borders. No arrows or diagrams.\nMaintain the same visual style throughout. No additional frames, overlays, logos or words."
    },
